WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:26.340
<i>Today is finally the day I'll receive
Lady Marie Antoinette at the Rhine River.</i>

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:28.590
<i>This is my first job as the Commander
of the Royal Guards.</i>

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:29.300
Oscar!

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:30.770
Oscar!

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:32.780
Oscar!

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:36.970
What? A double?

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:42.020
I have been informed of a disquieting move
to possibly kidnap Lady Marie Antoinette.

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:46.370
Your duty is to protect
Lady Antoinette with your life.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:49.340
If something should occur, wear this
and act as her double!

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:00.220
Oscar!

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:04.150
You're not planning to abandon
your duty, are you?!

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.500
Now that I have worn this military uniform,

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.090
I swear on my uniform and on this sword,
that I will fulfill my duty!

