00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:57.280
episode

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:57.280
\h               "Fly!"

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:01.140
<i>In 1770,</i>

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:05.840
<i>it was decided that Marie Antoinette,
who was coming to France for her marriage,</i>

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:10.370
<i>would be received on the sandbank of the Rhine,
a river that runs between France and Austria.</i>

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:14.320
<i>To preserve the honor and to adhere to
the detailed customs of both countries,</i>

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:17.860
<i>the marriage negotiations
took a year to complete.</i>

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:22.380
<i>In addition, a neutral territory was
carefully chosen as her receiving point.</i>

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:24.760
<i>And in Vienna...</i>

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.860
Lady Marie!

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:55.190
Lady Antoinette!

00:03:55.190 --> 00:03:56.960
There she is!

00:03:57.860 --> 00:03:59.860
Lady Marie!

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:01.900
My, your dress is completely soaked.

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:06.890
Lady Marie, please don't make
any more of my hairs turn gray.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:11.110
I'm sorry, Marquise.
It was just too beautiful.

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:12.650
Here! Have a look!

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:29.730
<i>Marie...</i>

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:31.200
<i>She's just 14 years old.</i>

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.900
<i>Marie is still a carefree and playful tomboy.</i>

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:39.500
<i>Perhaps the Royal Crown and the position
of Queen will only bring her misfortune?</i>

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:43.510
<i>Could I have I made a terrible mistake?</i>

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:47.010
<i>Oh, I'm dreadfully worried...</i>

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.980
<i>Somehow I sense misfortune lies ahead...</i>

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:58.440
Marie...

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:04.700
<i>This marriage is absolutely necessary for
the peace between Austria and France.</i>

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:07.800
<i>I, Maria Theresa,</i>

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:14.030
<i>as the Empress of Austria, must consider the
prosperity and security of my country first!</i>

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:24.350
My...! My, how beautiful!

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:26.220
Yes, she is so beautiful!

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:27.820
Your raised hair suits you so well, too.

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:30.320
You already look like a queen.

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:31.980
You look so beautiful.

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:41.600
Mother!

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.400
Well, Mother? Aren't I pretty?

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:47.200
Marie.

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:48.450
Yes?

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:51.810
You have a number of virtues.

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:57.250
However, you are capricious, playful
to no end, and are a shallow thinker.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:59.500
So take this with you.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:04.850
Think of this list of instructions as your mother,
and read it on this day, every month.

00:06:20.470 --> 00:06:22.240
Time for departure!

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:24.320
Time for departure!

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.430
Time for departure!

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:31.810
No! I can't, I'm scared!

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:40.620
I'll always be with you.

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:51.800
Thank you, Mother...

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:53.340
Marie...

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:55.870
Rhine River,
Pavilion to Receive the Bride

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:00.660
If you see anyone suspicious,
report it immediately!

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:18.290
Oscar, France and Austria are guarding
this event with national interest.

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:21.180
No one would dare to cause any
trouble with so much security.

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:22.490
Yes...

00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:35.200
They'll be arriving shortly.

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:38.500
Everything is set, Duke Orléans.

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:41.040
I told you not to mention that name!

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:52.300
Jean.

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:55.760
Jean?

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:57.800
I-Is that really you, Jean?!

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:05.110
Well, I'll be damned...

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:08.690
You must take her alive. Understand?

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:11.000
Let's go!

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:23.390
<i>I will ruin this union no matter what!</i>

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:28.030
<i>Louis XV and the Dauphin will become the
laughing stock of Europe and be dethroned.</i>

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:31.660
<i>Then I, Orléans, will be crowned the next king.</i>

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:49.680
Lady Marie, the Crossing-Over
Ceremony will soon begin.

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:50.940
Please change your clothing.

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:53.230
What? I have to take my clothes off?

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:56.990
Yes, you are not allowed to
wear anything from Austria,

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:59.460
not even a single thread, when crossing over.

00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:03.670
Everything you change into must be from France.

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:05.500
E-Everything?

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:10.230
Yes, your laces, ribbons, cross, undergarments...

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:11.290
Even your rings.

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:12.560
My rings?!

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:14.860
This ring, too?

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:19.220
<i>I'll always be with you.</i>

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:22.370
I refuse!

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:24.180
I won't take my dress off either!

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:25.310
Lady Marie!

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:27.920
It's a custom! Please change!

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:29.590
I'm going back.

00:10:29.590 --> 00:10:31.520
I've decided to not get married.

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:35.660
What's wrong? Has something happened?

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:39.320
Yes, after all this, it seems she's
complaining about the marriage.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:41.460
Oh, women...

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:44.740
Send word to His Majesty that there
will be a slight delay in the schedule.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:45.560
Yes!

00:10:49.470 --> 00:10:51.280
Unbelievable, that woman!

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:52.940
At the very last minute, too!

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:54.550
What?

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:57.150
Well, you weren't much different.

00:10:57.150 --> 00:10:59.220
You refused to wear the military uniform
until the very last minute, too.

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:01.880
I'm different from that shrew!

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:12.490
What's wrong, Oscar?

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:16.400
One of the attendants looked like a man to me.

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:18.700
Oh, come on, Oscar.

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:21.430
You're being overly suspicious today.

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:27.510
Lady Marie!

00:11:27.150 --> 00:11:28.410
Lady Marie!

00:11:27.780 --> 00:11:30.080
Where are you, Lady Marie?

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:30.920
Lady Marie!

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:31.950
Lady Marie!

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:33.880
Lady Antoinette!

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:33.880
Lady Antoinette!

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:39.670
Lady Antoinette...!

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:42.760
Lady Antoinette, please come here.

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:52.000
Lady Antoinette!

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:52.870
Lady Marie!

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:54.940
Lady Antoinette!

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:56.700
Exchange our dresses?!

00:11:59.010 --> 00:11:59.700
Yes.

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:01.180
Have you found her?

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:02.380
No, she's nowhere to be found.

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:03.780
Keep looking then!

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:03.780
Yes!

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:06.610
Lady Marie!

00:12:08.590 --> 00:12:10.880
Where could Lady Marie be hiding...?

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:15.710
I've grown tired of playing hide and seek.

00:12:16.490 --> 00:12:20.160
Oh, Lady Marie! Please stop playing games!

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:22.000
Here, you must hurry and change!

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:42.830
<i>My!</i>

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:46.370
<i>So I become you and you become me?</i>

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:51.030
<i>Sounds like fun!</i>

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:54.920
<i>I'll disguise myself as an attendant and surprise everyone when we arrive in France!</i>

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:04.580
That's...

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:05.930
...not the same attendant as before!

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:18.590
Is someone there?

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:22.450
Anyone?

00:13:31.030 --> 00:13:31.830
Who's there?!

00:13:37.030 --> 00:13:39.410
We've come to escort you,
Princess Antoinette.

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:42.750
We will be accompanying you, Princess.

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:43.930
Come, we must hurry.

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:45.380
How dare you!

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:49.300
She lives up to her reputation as a shrew!

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:52.060
We can't let you leave!

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:54.960
No matter! Tie her up!

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:57.020
What are you doing?! How dare you!

00:13:58.180 --> 00:13:59.030
Stop!

00:14:08.020 --> 00:14:09.490
You're Lady Antoinette, yes?

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:12.410
Who are you?

00:14:13.570 --> 00:14:16.170
Damn it! Who are you?!

00:14:16.170 --> 00:14:18.130
Commander of the French Royal Guards, Oscar!

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:19.870
Why you...!

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:41.800
You're so brilliant, Oscar!

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:52.540
What happened to Commander Oscar?!

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:54.280
She's nowhere to be found.

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:56.310
The transfer went without a hitch and now this!

00:14:57.360 --> 00:14:58.290
Is this one of her womanly whims?

00:14:59.380 --> 00:15:00.880
We're ready to depart!

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:03.850
Is something wrong?

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:05.470
No, it's nothing.

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:08.150
Commander Oscar will be joining us later!

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:10.680
I, Girodelle, will take command in her stead!

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:11.280
Forward, march!

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:40.370
After them!

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.030
Come back here!

00:15:41.630 --> 00:15:42.690
Stop!

00:15:59.880 --> 00:16:01.080
Don't let them get away!

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:41.020
Who are you?

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:42.360
Are you English?

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.560
You're French, aren't you?!

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:47.280
Why did you do this?!
And for whom?!

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:49.290
Th-That's...

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:53.890
What's wrong?

00:16:56.970 --> 00:16:57.870
Who's there?!

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:06.040
Come back here!

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:10.590
<i>Who could he possibly be?</i>

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:13.090
<i>Somewhere, I've...!</i>

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:19.750
The Dauphine has arrived!

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:50.220
Please wait!

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:54.380
That person is an impostor!

00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:58.510
Oscar, have you gone mad?

00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:01.770
The real Princess Marie Antoinette is here!

00:18:30.230 --> 00:18:31.130
Wait!

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:47.350
Duke Orléans!

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:49.600
This man was unarmed!

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:51.350
Why did you have to kill him?!

00:18:52.140 --> 00:18:54.410
This scoundrel conspired against the royal family.

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:55.570
His fate was deserved!

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:14.880
All right,

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:17.700
time for the bride and groom to meet.

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:21.390
Now why are you being shy?

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:24.470
This is your pretty bride.

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:26.790
Come on, what are you waiting for?

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:31.090
This is my grandson, the Dauphin Louis-Auguste.

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:34.230
He's rather shy as you can see.

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:46.160
<i>He's... to be my husband?</i>

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:48.680
What are you standing there for?

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:51.610
Go ahead and greet your
bride with a kiss already!

00:20:02.650 --> 00:20:03.970
<i>That's it...?</i>

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:07.860
<i>I just received my first kiss
from my husband-to-be...</i>

00:20:07.860 --> 00:20:11.820
<i>...and my heart feels nothing,
not even a flutter...</i>

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:16.340
There we go!

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:18.980
Come, I'll introduce you to the
members of the royal family.

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:23.100
Louis's younger brothers,
Count Provence...

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:24.740
...and Count Artois.

00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:28.180
And Louis's cousin, Duke Orléans.

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:33.450
Well then, let us leave for Versailles!

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:35.460
A magnificent wedding ceremony awaits!

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:54.940
To think if Oscar hadn't been there...

00:20:55.510 --> 00:20:57.480
Yes, I probably would be dead by now.

00:20:57.950 --> 00:20:59.700
My, how terrifying.

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:02.280
Although a woman, she possesses such valor.

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:04.530
What?! A woman?!

00:21:05.190 --> 00:21:09.620
Yes, she's a woman and also the Commander
of your Royal Guards, Lady Antoinette.

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:11.360
A woman...

00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:46.110
Master Fersen, before you is Lady Marie
Antoinette's marriage procession.

00:21:51.340 --> 00:21:52.830
<i>Oscar,</i>

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:54.420
<i>Antoinette...</i>

00:21:54.420 --> 00:21:55.840
<i>and Fersen...</i>

00:21:56.490 --> 00:21:59.940
<i>The day of their fateful encounter draws near.</i>

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:06.880
<i>Into the French Revolution,
which will soon inevitably occur,</i>

00:22:06.880 --> 00:22:12.950
<i>towards Oscar, Antoinette and Fersen's
complexly intertwined destinies,</i>

00:22:13.790 --> 00:22:19.000
<i>and towards the Palace of Versailles,
where decadence and conspiracy swirls,</i>

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:22.990
<i>the procession marches on,
silently and solemnly.</i>

00:22:28.080 --> 00:22:32.500
To be continued

